### Topic 66 - Docker demo requests (VS Code "REST Client")
### Works the same whether the app runs with mvn spring-boot:run or inside a container
### started with: docker run -d --name demo -p 8080:8080 docker-demo:1.0

@app = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Greeting + host name (inside Docker: the container id)
GET {{app}}/api/hello

### 2. Runtime info: Java version, user (should be "spring", not root), max heap, profiles
GET {{app}}/api/info

### 3. Health (used by the Docker HEALTHCHECK)
GET {{app}}/actuator/health

### 4. Kubernetes-style probes (topic 69)
GET {{app}}/actuator/health/liveness

###
GET {{app}}/actuator/health/readiness
